/*
  WhyEndedPanel.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0152 · WhyEndedPanel (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `WhyEndedPanel` resolves (table "WhyEndedPanel") lives here with its web `t(key,
  default)` English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings`
  master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each
  parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/driving/components/drive-detail/WhyEndedPanel.tsx — the title, the
  window-option labels, the section titles, the signal column headers, the error +
  empty states, and the `trigger: {{trigger}}` template). The second group backs
  the native-only chrome (disclosure a11y, freshness chip, connectivity banner,
  loading, pagination, accessibility) the Apple HIG states contract requires.
*/

